Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:06.19,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for lending me the violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:08.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're sorry about borrowing it for an entire week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:12.99,Default,Nis,0,0,0,,This actually isn't the school's property.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:18.03,Default,Nis,0,0,0,,It's something a graduate from several years ago left here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:23.29,Default,Nis,0,0,0,,I was asked by a teacher to check if it could still be played,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:26.50,Default,Nis,0,0,0,,since it is an old violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:29.04,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,That violin…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:35.18,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,…it is old and the strings are wearing out,\Nbut it is a wonderful violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:37.76,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,So please don't throw it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:40.18,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.85,0:00:45.89,Default,Nis,0,0,0,,Yes. I was planning to tell that to the teacher, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:47.90,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.31,0:00:50.40,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I had forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.69,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Hello. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:56.86,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,My name is Ichinose Kotomi. A senior in Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.86,0:00:58.66,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,My hobby is reading books.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:02.45,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I would be happy if you would become my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:07.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The “nice to meet you” is strange since you've already met, but that's how it is.{liberties were taken with this line due to "hajimemashite" not having an equivalent}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:10.21,Default,Nis,0,0,0,,My name is Nishina Rie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:12.92,Default,Nis,0,0,0,,It's nice to make your acquaintence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:16.72,Default,Nis,0,0,0,,See you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:24.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad you made more friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:25.14,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:27.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It'll be nice to see the number increase like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:28.60,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Yup.
