Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:59.82,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\be1}without leaving anything behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:11.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I hear Kotomi-chan is attending classes instead of staying in the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's go take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.75,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey, Ichinose-san. The third problem here…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:23.80,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,First you set x = cos θ, and then this becomes this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:26.47,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,So the answer is π/9.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:28.22,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I get it! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:30.39,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You really are smart, Ichinose-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:34.94,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. You were the one that was doing the violin concert the other day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:38.03,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What? You can play the violin, Ichinose-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:40.36,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You should have told us, and we would have been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:45.45,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I walked by, but you don't call that “playing”.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:47.12,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:50.41,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It made me back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:50.41,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,It's a little embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:56.17,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 12
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:56.17,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Hidden World
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.92,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Naive! You're too naive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:02.38,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,A world made up of only jabbers means there is no one to play the dumb role.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:07.80,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So there'd only be jabbers in bowties from here to the end of the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:11.23,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Try missing a line or making\Na ridiculous comment in that situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:12.60,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What do you think would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:14.77,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,What will happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.77,0:04:16.40,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:17.94,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:20.11,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That's enough out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:20.11,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:21.78,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I've had enough from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.53,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What in the world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:28.58,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You'd get slapped with one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:31.20,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It'd be a really, really harsh world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:34.41,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Jabs are very scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:35.54,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:39.59,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,it's impossible for you to go into the comedy world even if you were reborn a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:42.46,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,O-Onee-chan. I think you're being too harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:45.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. If we all work together, I'm sure—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:48.43,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's worthless even if you three work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:50.68,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Zero is always zero no matter\Nhow many of them are brought together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's being really harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.23,0:04:57.06,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Then I must resort to my last trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:59.69,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'll show you an amazing joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:03.07,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I hope it's not something really old again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:06.91,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's something I just learned from the TV the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:08.53,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's really new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:11.83,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.71,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It bends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:23.96,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That's a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:25.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:28.26,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,They come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:30.22,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:35.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You sure made a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:37.85,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I wanted everyone to enjoy some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:42.23,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan, what do you usually do when there's no school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.36,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'm usually reading books.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:48.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I usually waste time at Sunohara's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:51.03,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think I'm usually at home, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.03,0:05:52.74,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You guys are pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:59.00,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,The youngsters in the midst of youth are all wasting their time and bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:06:01.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you have stuff to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:02.09,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:03.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.51,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,But I just made a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:08.51,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Everyone. Meet at the station at nine tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:11.18,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Group dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.68,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Group outing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:16.27,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,This is what innocent youngsters should be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:27.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm the only guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:30.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If we'd asked Sunohara, I bet he\Nwould've come with his tail wagging.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.41,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:33.33,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,One idiot per group is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:35.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Would that one idiot be you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:39.75,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! Of course it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:42.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, you come really close in the race, too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:47.17,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Onee-chan. Kotomi-chan says it's almost her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:49.84,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Yup. It's next Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:53.35,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Okay! We'll get you a present with our hearts in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:05.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.53,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It won't budge at all again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:11.49,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey staff! The placement of the prize is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:13.07,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,No one can ever get this if it's like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:14.74,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:16.83,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Will you give me a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:16.83,Default-alt,Guy,0,0,0,,She's still up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:19.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is the present with your heart in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:23.38,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,That doll is really big.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:27.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is it all right to make it bigger than the actual animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.42,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:31.01,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:34.64,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Here's my thirty-fourth try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:38.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just so you know, this is your last round. I'm completely broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:40.23,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You're up next, Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:42.56,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I-I don't have the confidence at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:44.27,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I failed last time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.27,0:07:45.61,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,In that case, the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:51.40,Default,Nas,0,0,0,,Me, too. I feel like I would put Okazaki-san's money to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:52.11,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Then I'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:53.16,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You worthless bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:56.74,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Isn't there anyone confident enough to declare that they can get it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:02.00,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuuko's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:09.88,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:14.80,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuuko saw that you were in trouble,\Nso Fuuko ran here, wishing to be of aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.89,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Leave everything to Fuuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:19.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Excuse me, we've met before, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:22.68,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You don't have to remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:25.77,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,The day when we naturally reunite will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:28.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Can you really get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:31.40,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuuko is a master at this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:36.07,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,so much so that neighbors say that no one can compare to Fuko when it comes to manipulating cranes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:37.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What kind of neighbors do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:40.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I feel like I've had this conversation before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:45.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The target is that big thing. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:47.42,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Here goes Fuuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:07.15,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,The shape attracted Fuuko and made Fuuko's hand move unconsciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:10.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just so you know, that's a star, not a starfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:16.45,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuuko couldn't be of help this time, but Fuuko wants to come again to help again another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.36,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.29,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:24.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why did I say “starfish”?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:31.46,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,We couldn't decide on a present in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:34.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We still have time, so let's take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:37.97,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,A contrail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:39.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:43.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kotomi, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:52.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Our home's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:56.61,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Nagisa-chan, Kyou-chan, Ryou-chan, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:59.03,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Yes, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:10:00.20,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:07.04,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tomoya-kun. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:13.17,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,If I hadn't met you, I don't think I would have had so much fun. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:16.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:19.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa, Kyou, and Fujibayashi just like you. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:20.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's all. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:24.89,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,If that's true, I'll be really happy. {ep 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:31.19,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, there's something I want to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.65,0:10:35.94,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I want you to hold on to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:41.28,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I've already memorized everything in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:44.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You want me to read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:50.08,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,No, you don't have to read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:52.88,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Just hold on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:57.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He's the guy from the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.18,0:11:02.22,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,The bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:03.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:16.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Looks like he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:19.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:22.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What business does he have with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I've been having strange dreams lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:04.66,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Guess who, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.66,0:12:07.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your breasts! They're pressing against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:10.66,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Munegasawatteru Munega-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:12.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you a gymnast from Russia or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:17.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're Ichinose Kotomi, and your breasts are pressed right against my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:22.88,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,My heart is really, really pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:25.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who sent you to do this embarrassing joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:27.47,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:31.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop teaching Kotomi strange things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:33.73,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Why not? There's nothing to lose from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:35.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kyou-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:45.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kyou-chan! Ryou-chan comes to school by bus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:47.74,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah, she does. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:50.79,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She always gets on the bus around this time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:54.41,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So why are you in such a panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:59.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,There was a bus accident at the intersection below, and there was a crowd of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:03.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It looked like a big accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:05.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Maybe Ryou-chan got…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:08.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,No! It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:12.02,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If anything were to happen to Ryou, there's no way I wouldn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.72,0:13:13.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kyou!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:27.07,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Wow… I've never seen a bus roll over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:29.28,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,There could be people hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:31.12,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:32.04,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Onee-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Ryou-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:37.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Fujibayashi! You were safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.38,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You weren't on that bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:43.71,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I was on the bus right after that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:47.38,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,The road got jammed, so I fell behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:51.68,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,That bus was on its way back to the depot, so no one was on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:54.31,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Both the bus driver and the other driver are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.31,0:13:54.97,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:58.77,Default,Bus,0,0,0,,You're the one that ignored the light and came in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:01.11,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I only went fast since it was yellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.11,0:14:02.65,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,It's your fault for not paying attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:05.99,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Fine, fine! We'll listen to the rest somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:10.28,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank goodness no one was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.20,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:19.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making things dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's good to know that it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:28.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:30.18,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Ryou-chan's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.14,0:14:39.52,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:56.66,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:58.33,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kotomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:15:01.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kotomi! Kotomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:03.21,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'll be a good girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:07.17,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'll be a good girl, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:08.42,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:10.13,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan, get a hold of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:12.01,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hospital! Ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:13.60,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Actually, the nurse's office!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:17.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Left early?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:21.10,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah. She left halfway through the first period.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:22.02,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:25.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's what the school nurse said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She looked like she was going through something serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:29.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is it all right to let her go home alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:33.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We asked the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:38.37,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,She said it's related to Ichinose-san's privacy, so she couldn't share anything more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:39.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:42.54,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Let's go to the teacher's lounge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:45.17,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Her homeroom teacher should know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:52.47,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,She came to me and said that she wasn't feeling well, so she wanted to go home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:54.93,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What happened to Ichinose-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:57.06,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What is this privacy deal about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:15:59.81,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,It's called privacy because we can't tell you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:02.69,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,You'll have to wait until Ichinose-san shares the story with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:07.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Would it be all right for us to go visit her house?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.15,0:16:10.90,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,I feel it's best to leave her alone right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:14.70,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,But sure. Let me write down her address for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.70,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Don't try to force her to meet you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:22.96,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan thought I got hurt, so she fell into a state of shock…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:27.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's my fault. If I hadn't said there was an accident…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Neither of you are at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:33.01,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.93,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:40.39,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,…we weren't really her friends yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.35,0:16:45.73,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Is she not home?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:49.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Maybe she's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:53.28,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,How about we call it a day and come back tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:55.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:58.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:16:59.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:08.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:11.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:14.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You've been spacing out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.01,0:17:18.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That house has been bugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:22.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what it is exactly…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:26.27,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:27.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You guys head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:28.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:29.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you think you're doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:42.87,Default,Man,0,0,0,,You're the boy from the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:44.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you have some business with this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:47.54,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:51.34,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I can't blame you for suspecting me for what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:58.63,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I rang the bell, but no one answered,\Nso I came around to the yard to see if anyone is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:01.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.76,0:18:04.81,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I'm an acquaintance of Kotomi-kun's parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:07.56,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I was a member of their lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:11.11,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I knew Kotomi-kun from when she was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:13.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did you come to meet Kotomi's parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:18.11,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Oh, so you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:23.58,Default,Man,0,0,0,,If she's keeping it a secret,\Nthen it's not something I should say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:26.37,Default,Man,0,0,0,,It's a private matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:28.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's exactly what sensei said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:33.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kotomi's parents are amazing scientists, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:35.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are they that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:42.64,Default,Man,0,0,0,,What we can observe isn't the only universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:48.77,Default,Man,0,0,0,,There is a realm that was shed and sealed away while this world was taking form.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:51.27,Default,Man,0,0,0,,The hidden world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:54.98,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Her parents were the first to find evidence of such a world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:58.44,Default,Man,0,0,0,,To be precise, they had supposedly found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:02.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This sounds like a complicated story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:08.41,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,In any case, it was an honor for us,\Nbeing able to assist the Ichinoses' research.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:10.37,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:13.96,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,No, this is as much as I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:17.80,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Did Kotomi-kun say anything about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:19.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:21.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,“A bad person.”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:26.81,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I guess that's what we still are to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:31.60,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Are you her classmate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:34.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not in the same class, but I am her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:36.11,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:40.49,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,When you have the chance,\NI would like you to pass on these words.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:47.74,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,“I don't expect you to forgive us,\Nbut we still regret what happened that day.”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:49.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:50.37,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:52.08,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Excuse me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:59.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This place seems familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:07.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I never entered through the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:42.47,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Day before yesterday I saw a rabbit,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:09.37,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Day before yesterday I saw a rabbit,
